<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia reports final official election results.</title>
<headline>Slovenia reports final official election results.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Election Committee reported on Monday the following final official results of a general election held on November 10 for the 90-seat lower house of parliament.</p>
<p>    party				  percentage	   seats</p>
<p>    Liberal Democrats		    27.01		  25</p>
<p>    People's Party			 19.38		  19</p>
<p>    Social Democrats		     16.13		  16</p>
<p>    Christian Democrats		   9.62		  10</p>
<p>    United List of Social Democrats   9.03		   9</p>
<p>    Democratic Pensioners' Party	4.32		   5</p>
<p>    Nationalist Party		     3.22		   4</p>
<p>Two seats are reserved for the Italian and Hungarian Miniorities.</p>
<p>Turnout 73.7 percent.</p>
</text>
